278
00:20:35,580 --> 00:20:37,920
Those with greater skills and talents

279
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,640
Are my top priority to protect

280
00:20:39,640 --> 00:20:46,500
My objective is to annihilate that upper-ranked demon

281
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:48,480
And protect the village at all costs

282
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:53,040
Saving an inexperienced budding swordsmith

283
00:20:53,040 --> 00:20:54,020
Won't amount to any

284
00:20:54,020 --> 00:20:56,180
Life is a way of rewarding good deeds

285
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:57,680
Often when you help others

286
00:20:57,680 --> 00:20:58,640
You're helping yourself

287
00:20:58,640 --> 00:21:16,000
Run

288
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,720
It's you

289
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:27,120
Run for it before you get in my way even more

290
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:43,080
I got the element ii

291
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:43,140
but evenelf

292
