You remember that

293
00:21:44,780 --> 00:21:45,240
You've always been doing my same tag

294
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,960
I go the element ii

295
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:47,940
No, you can't find there

296
00:21:47,940 --> 00:21:49,880
There's always a work

297
00:21:49,880 --> 00:21:52,260
You walked

298
