But are you alright?

304
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:11,600
Thankfully, Mr. Hageneska forged this for me.

305
00:23:12,260 --> 00:23:15,040
It's good to see Mr. Hageneska hasn't changed.

306
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:17,620
If he did, it wouldn't be for the better.

307
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:21,900
Now it's time for a Taisho-era secret.

308
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:27,100
Mr. Hageneska has wind chimes on his umbrella because he really likes wind chimes.

309
00:23:27,360 --> 00:23:29,780
And when he was little, every time he threw a tantrum,

310
00:23:29,920 --> 00:23:33,080
the grown-ups around him would play wind chimes to try and quiet him down.

311
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:35,000
Wow, I didn't know that.

312
00:23:35,160 --> 00:23:36,740
This is for you, Mr. Tanjiro.

313
00:23:36,940 --> 00:23:39,700
