315
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,560
Wind chime, chime, chime!

316
00:23:43,560 --> 00:23:45,540
Stop treating me like a child!

317
00:23:45,900 --> 00:23:47,140
Chime, chime, chime!

318
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,860
